msgstr ""

#: processes/process/crdm-requirements.bpmn:81
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Between requirements and sign-off, and the order is the argument: requirements are statements about things, and the model says what the things ARE. Drafted earlier it is invented from nothing, since the entities come from the phase-2 BPA; drafted later, sign-off approves requirements whose nouns were never pinned — which is how two stakeholders approve one sentence meaning different things. Owner, 2026-09-20."
msgstr ""

