msgstr ""

#: processes/process/crdm-requirements.bpmn:125
#. Diagram label
msgid "not yours"
msgstr ""

#: processes/process/crdm-requirements.bpmn:104
#. Diagram label
msgid "Not yours — left alone"
msgstr ""

#: processes/process/crdm-requirements.bpmn:89
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "One phase and not three, because the loops say so: an increment the BA rejects, an MVP that is not ready, and stakeholder findings all route back into implementation. A subprocess has one exit and cannot be re-entered once finished, so splitting this region would have changed what the diagram says."
msgstr ""

